"Finlay is a Scottish S-rank speedster in Alden Thorn's CNH hero class."
"In the assessment's final duel he beat Alden in seconds and dislocated his shoulder."
"He runs on the streets, signalling his turns by hand."
"He is too nice, per Lute; his CNH roommates include Jeffy."
"He chose CNH over Li Jean; his favorite hero is the speedster Liu Arielle."
"His father is a retired electrician who bought a money-losing pub."
"His roommate Winston resents him, a rivalry called the Fin-Win feud."
"His spell impression Surface Extension is unusually high-ranked for a beginner."
"In December 2040 Li Jean accepted him to its S-rank Elites program, and he is proud of it."
"He is undecided about Elites, fearing it is full of S-rank Winstons."
"By January 2041 he attends Elites, with curfews, more gym time and a social media break."
